the game is still for sale despite being unplayable in the current state", "timestamp_created": 1780590575, "timestamp_updated": 1780590575, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 77, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.854861259460449219", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 6}, {"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "227130205", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144770928", "personaname": "Vlad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vladrosendo/", "num_games_owned": 198, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 437, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 437, "last_played": 1780540605, "avatar": "d8df8daabc18607127ea2932b4cd806b1416715e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Tentei gostar do jogo, dei mais de uma chance jogando em momentos diferentes, mas o sentimento é sempre o mesmo: tédio. A cidade inteira me trouxe aquela sensação de vagar por um servidor online abandonado, mas de um jeito bem negativo. Não tive interesse em nada, nem história, nem personagens e nem no mundo em si.\r\nO combate foi bem chatinho, inimigos praticamente não reagem, as armas são sem graça e as skills são bem genéricas. Sem contar que ficar ciscando igual uma galinha pra pegar munição e items no chão chega a dar sono.", "timestamp_created": 1780541028, "timestamp_updated": 1780541028, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226908343", "author": {"steamid": "76561198950745215", "personaname": "Astral Affinity", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198950745215/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 17, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17, "last_played": 1780215597, "avatar": "43b603912c2716e089336f931d91d115685ddab3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a game of what if's and could have been. I do hope someone out there decides to remaster it to a playable state, but waiting over two hours to connect to a server was something I expect on a massively crowded mmo on an expansion launch day, not for this. It had everything I was looking for but you can't even play it because of server bugs years later. Tragic really.  Save your time, sanity, and money and pass.", "timestamp_created": 1780272369, "timestamp_updated": 1780272369, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.589735448360443115", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}]}]}